{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07299","headline":"金陵西泊舟临江楼 · 刘长卿","name":"金陵西泊舟临江楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧条金陵郭，旧是帝王州。\n日暮望乡处，云边江树秋。\n楚云不可托，楚水只堪愁。\n行客千万里，沧波朝暮流。\n迢迢洛阳梦，独卧清川楼。\n异乡共如此，孤帆难久游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}